#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0117 expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
#note "THE LOAD-BEARING-GUARD PIN (finding AD0117-F1). ATPTN absent. Data would fire under the degraded key (regroup on [PARAMCD] alone, flagging the minority POSTDOSE row), but the rule is silent because var_exists(ATPTN) is false - ATPT and PARAMCD are present so their not empty(...) conjuncts do not silence it. ATPT is still present so Requirements.Variables.All [ATPT] does not skip the rule."
#library standard=adamig version=1-0
#expectViolationCount 0
dataset ADLBC
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col ATPT    type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | GLUC | PREDOSE
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1023 | GLUC | PREDOSE
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1034 | GLUC | POSTDOSE
